WEBVTT

00:05:28.996 --> 00:05:31.916
with a little help
from plants and microbes.

00:05:32.796 --> 00:05:36.956
Rebuilding soil is going to require us
to fundamentally rethink our reliance

00:05:36.956 --> 00:05:39.796
on technology and chemicals

00:05:39.836 --> 00:05:42.556
to deliver what soils can do on their own:

00:05:42.596 --> 00:05:43.836
support life.

00:05:44.396 --> 00:05:47.516
And life in soil is mostly microbial.

00:05:48.156 --> 00:05:50.556
The Dutch scientist,
Antoni van Leeuwenhoek,

00:05:50.596 --> 00:05:54.636
saw tiny organisms
he called the "wee beasties,"

00:05:54.676 --> 00:05:57.916
under his microscope about 350 years ago.

00:05:58.236 --> 00:06:01.996
And with the rapid innovation of molecular
and computational tools,